    "areas": ["customer-flow","frontend","operations-support"],
    "notes": [
      "Activates the existing device CSV fallback while preserving Google Drive as the primary persistent pilot connector.",
      "Reuses the existing owner-only multipart preview and fingerprint-bound confirmation endpoints; no API, database, ingestion-policy or Drive permission changes are authorized.",
      "The mobile picker is restricted to one CSV and avoids base64/raw-byte storage in application state; only a transient selected-file reference is retained through confirmation.",
      "Preview exposes only privacy-safe counts, date range, recognized/ignored column summaries and metric keys before the owner confirms ingestion.",
      "Release and production enablement remain out of scope."
    ]
  },
